ngFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">手里攥着 150 亿新弹药，账上却烧出 109 亿亏损：OpenAI 备战 IPO</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">MiniMax正式开源原生4K生图模型H3 Image，登顶全球开放权重榜单</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Claude推出全新Claude Meetings功能，支持以可见参会者身份加入实时视频通话</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini 4 Hydrogen模型，编程性能与推理速度大幅提升</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布新一代大模型Gemini 4 Hydrogen，重点强化编程能力与智能体（Agent）任务处理效率。相比前代Gemini 3.8 Flash，该模型运行速度提升2.5倍，在Terminal-Bench 4.1编程基准测试中得分从18.2%跃升至57%，并显著降低了幻觉率。Gemini 4 Hydrogen支持高达100万词元的输入与输出，API定价为输入每百万词元1.50美元，输出每百万词元7.50美元。谷歌同步推出Orchestrator功能，支持多模型间的动态任务分配与协同。普通用户可通过Gemini应用自动调用该模型，开发者则可通过API接入。此次更新旨在通过更高效的推理与更强的终端操作能力，优化复杂工作流的处理表现。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达创始人黄仁勋卸任总裁与CEO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2842940a916071785fed87a4a0d02918.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达创始人黄仁勋卸任总裁与CEOAIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 13, 202618人工智能行业的权力格局在近日迎来了一场堪称“地震”的剧烈震荡。英伟达官方发布正式公告宣布，创立公司长达33年、几乎将个人影响力与品牌深度绑定的灵魂人物黄仁勋，正式卸任公司总裁、首席执行官和董事职务，消息一出立即引发全球科技界的高度关注与股价波动。从地缘博弈到巨额暗流:算力危机下的“Megaspeed”谜局 要理清这场震荡的来龙去脉，必须将时间拨回到2022年大模型爆发前夕。随着算力成为 AI 时代的战略级资源，美国自当年秋季起对面向中国市场的先进芯片出口实施了严厉禁令。在庞大市场需求的驱动下，市场上逐渐衍生出走私、借道第三国以及跨国远程访问算力等多种迂回路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">手里攥着 150 亿新弹药，账上却烧出 109 亿亏损：OpenAI 备战 IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/582a5a22738f6362a99e79de2688fac9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">手里攥着 150 亿新弹药，账上却烧出 109 亿亏损：OpenAI 备战 IPOAIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 13, 20268CNBC 11 月 13 日披露，OpenAI 刚完成的最新一轮私募融资规模达 150 亿美元（约合 1003 亿元人民币），融资前估值站上 1.25 万亿美元（约 8.36 万亿元）。这比此前媒体放风的约 110 亿美元还要高出一截，且交易尚未正式收口，预计几周内落定。圈内将其定性为&quot;机会性融资&quot;——核心目的，是为预计 2027 年启动的 IPO 提前备好粮草。账本上的百亿伤口 弹药背后是醒目的失血。《华尔街日报》数据显示，OpenAI 今年第三季度营收约 100 亿美元，环比猛增近 50%。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax正式开源原生4K生图模型H3 Image，登顶全球开放权重榜单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9abdfe9eeff39f5692cc055327d0e05b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">MiniMax正式开源其原生4K直出图像模型H3 Image，该模型基于全模态视频模型H3衍生，发布后迅速登顶全球开放权重图像模型榜单。H3 Image在性能上具备显著优势，支持10秒极速出图，并可同时处理多达16张参考图，满足复杂场景下的风格迁移与细节控制需求。在真实感渲染、文字生成、人脸保持、图生图创作及复杂指令遵循等方面表现优异，覆盖日常创意至专业商业生产场景。MiniMax通过开源模型权重构建生态，并结合托管API、订阅计划及商业授权模式，打造可持续发展的商业闭环。此次开源旨在通过技术赋能开发者与企业用户，加速全球衍生生态的形成，进一步巩固其在人工智能图像生成领域的行业地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Claude推出全新Claude Meetings功能，支持以可见参会者身份加入实时视频通话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/10007140386e2179b000c2131d57eff2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Claude正式推出处于测试阶段的全新会议功能Claude Meetings，允许AI直接作为一名可见的参会者加入实时视频通话。该功能打破了以往AI仅能在会后生成会议纪要的局限，通过实时参与互动，实现对讨论内容的即时记录与分析。目前，Claude Meetings已率先面向Team（团队版）和Enterprise（企业版）套餐用户开放测试。此举标志着Claude在办公协同领域的进一步深耕，旨在通过将AI实时引入视频会议场景，打破企业内部信息孤岛，提升团队沟通与决策效率。随着测试的持续推进，该功能有望为企业级用户提供更加流畅、沉浸的智能协同体验，进一步强化Claude在办公生态中的应用价值。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
